(180, 3, '2014-06-03 03:06:43', '2014-06-03 03:06:43', 'Sean and Scott have been friends ever since 1990, when they both appeared as Starfish in the Cookeville Children\'s Theater production of The Perils of Pinocchio. in 1995, they both worked at ', 'Sean Powell', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '140-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-06-03 03:06:43', '2014-06-03 03:06:43', '', 140, 'http://scottyandallie.com/2014/06/03/140-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(181, 3, '2014-06-03 03:14:10', '2014-06-03 03:14:10', 'Jonathan and Scott met first in the 2nd Mid-State Jazz Band in 1996 and then terrorized the terrorized the Governor\'s School for the Arts later that summer. They went on cause problems at Interlochen Arts ', 'Jonathan Ford', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '141-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-06-03 03:14:10', '2014-06-03 03:14:10', '', 141, 'http://scottyandallie.com/2014/06/03/141-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(182, 3, '2014-06-03 03:16:01', '2014-06-03 03:16:01', 'Brian met Scott and Jonathan in 1998 at their first semester at FSU, and his life has arguably been worse ever since. Brian lingered in Tallahassee for a while past graduation, so he wa', 'Brian DeLadurantey', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '142-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-06-03 03:16:01', '2014-06-03 03:16:01', '', 142, 'http://scottyandallie.com/2014/06/03/142-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(183, 3, '2014-06-03 03:17:36', '2014-06-03 03:17:36', 'Eric studied abroad with Scott and Jonathan in Spring of 2001. In the mid \'00s, Eric had a penchant for showing up at Scott\'s apartment to party for the weekend and then leaving ', 'Eric Anderson', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '143-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-06-03 03:17:36', '2014-06-03 03:17:36', '', 143, 'http://scottyandallie.com/2014/06/03/143-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(184, 3, '2014-06-03 03:19:02', '2014-06-03 03:19:02', 'Scott and Brian moved to NYC at basically the same time and had only one connection in common, Allie. A stronger bromance has never existed, based on the mutual love for and attendance records held at B', 'Brian Gitman', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '144-autosave-v1', '', '', '2014-06-03 03:19:02', '2014-06-03 03:19:02', '', 144, 'http://scottyandallie.com/2014/06/03/144-autosave-v1/', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
