(199, 3, '2014-08-25 22:13:13', '2014-08-25 22:13:13', 'Liz and Allie have been friends since their formative years in Jersey. Liz has a deep passion for boy bands and has accompanied Allie to some important NKOTB performances. Liz is an expert in fashion and of course, HAIR.', 'Liz Boone', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'liz-boone', '', '', '2014-09-21 23:20:51', '2014-09-21 23:20:51', '', 0, 'http://scottyandallie.com/?post_type=wedding_party&#038;p=199', 0, 'wedding_party', '', 0),
