(230, 2, '2015-01-31 05:10:58', '2015-01-31 05:10:58', 'The bridal shower is scheduled for Sunday, March 1st at noon at Allie\'s childhood home in Westfield, New Jersey. <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><strong><a href=\"http://rsvpwpd.com/allief\">Kindly RSVP here</a></strong></span>.\r\n\r\nThis is also the last time to party at 420 -- the house we all loved for over 22 years is officially going to closing the very next day. It\'s the last day to light one up on the porch, feed the koi and wave to Mrs. Keuter.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"http://scottyandallie.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/Shower.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-231\" src=\"http://scottyandallie.com/wp-content/uploads/2015/01/Shower-221x300.jpg\" alt=\"Shower\" width=\"221\" height=\"300\" /></a>', 'Bridal Shower', '', 'draft', 'open', 'closed', '', 'bridal-shower', '', '', '2015-04-07 12:48:31', '2015-04-07 12:48:31', '', 0, 'http://scottyandallie.com/?p=230', 0, 'post', '', 0),
