(252, 2, '2015-02-01 04:14:42', '2015-02-01 04:14:42', 'The most awesome band ETURNITY is playing the wedding. This 12 piece ensemble is absolutely unreal. <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://www.eturnitybandstar.com/\">Check them out here</a></span>.\r\n\r\nFriday night, we\'ll have live Yacht Rock by AM Gold.\r\n\r\nSubmit song requests here:\r\n\r\n[contact-form subject=\'Scott and Allie#039;s Wedding Request Form\'][contact-field label=\'Name\' type=\'name\' required=\'1\'/][contact-field label=\'Comment\' type=\'textarea\' required=\'1\'/][/contact-form]\r\n\r\n&nbsp;', 'Request A Song', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'music', '', '', '2015-03-10 04:04:26', '2015-03-10 04:04:26', '', 0, 'http://scottyandallie.com/?page_id=252', 0, 'page', '', 0),
