(285, 3, '2015-05-16 19:56:07', '2015-05-16 19:56:07', 'Full Moon Resort is just 27 miles from Woodstock and Bearsville - both cool and laid-back towns. Here is a link to local activities: <strong><a href=\"http://woodstockguide.com/activities.html\" target=\"_blank\">http://woodstockguide.com/activities.html</a></strong>\r\n\r\nThe <strong><a href=\"http://woodstocksanctuary.org/\" target=\"_blank\">Woodstock Farm Animal Sanctuary</a></strong> is great during the day.\r\n\r\nIf you\'re feeling adventurous and want to see the famous Big Pink house, here\'s the address: <strong><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/56+Parnassus+Ln,+Saugerties,+NY+12477/data=!4m2!3m1!1s0x89dda86a2f54680d:0x480c16229dd8dfb2?sa=X&ei=naBXVcPAGvj-sAT9iILwAQ&ved=0CCAQ8gEwAA\">56 Parnassus Ln, Saugerties, NY 12477</a></strong>', 'Local Activities', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'local-activities', '', '', '2015-05-16 20:00:14', '2015-05-16 20:00:14', '', 117, 'http://scottyandallie.com/?page_id=285', 0, 'page', '', 0),
