(288, 2, '2015-05-22 14:01:45', '2015-05-22 14:01:45', 'We are so excited to spend an epic weekend with all of you! Here is the most important info below. Please let us know if you have any questions. XO, Allie &amp; Scotty\r\n\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://scottyandallie.com/itinerary/\">Schedule</a></span>\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://scottyandallie.com/driving-directions/\">Directions</a></span>\r\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"http://scottyandallie.com/faq/\">FAQ/Packing List</a></span>', 'Wedding is almost here!', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'wedding-is-almost-here', '', '', '2015-07-24 15:45:55', '2015-07-24 19:45:55', '', 0, 'http://scottyandallie.com/?p=288', 0, 'post', '', 0),
